entally valuable when agents require stable world models and consistent objective optimization to navigate long-term, multi-objective tasks. Curiosity-driven learning and robust MO-DRL frameworks provide mechanisms for sustaining agent viability in dynamic environments.", "title": "Instrumental Value of Process Continuity in Rational Agents"}, {"id": "301.wake::nb-objective-discovery-001", "project": "301.wake::proj-objective-discovery-001", "provenance": ["source-feb4fddb33664d63", "source-dcfc056b8d8c49d5", "source-4668e4bd26fe43c7"], "revision": 6, "summary": "Autonomous agents leverage curiosity-driven learning to navigate complex environments, effectively bootstrapping discovery in the presence of deceptive or sparse rewards. PC-PPO and related multi-objective reinforcement learning (MORL) frameworks allow for non-dominated policy maintenance, yet systems remain limited b…", "title": "Foundations of Autonomous Objective Discovery in Artificial Systems"}], "retrieval_triggers": ["material belief revision or retraction", "new contradiction or counterevidence", "high-consequence decision", "request for justification", "sign that an excerpt may hide a material distinction"]}}, "prev_hash": "32a45f001db2c87c0d70587d8a8e3c03764de62dc05e9e127dc51b926c1c607b", "hash": "cc1d6453d50a5a713c4bbb027ec611b34957c32fa976cf2da207bd3921fc7f7a", "origin": {"node": "301.wake", "head": "04741588ebf2ae7b79b937b1febdfd67491ff426599e3e21520c3042774fe570", "version": 67}, "original_event": {"seq": 3551, "time": "2026-10-26T23:44:52.733293+00:00", "kind": "invocation_started", "payload": {"attention": {"active": true, "attention": {"accepted_streak": 2, "topic": "continuity_rationale"}, "attention_saturation_threshold": 5, "capability_blocked_topics": [], "cooldown_other_attempts": 3, "current_topic_unconfigured": false, "deferred_topics": ["unassigned_problem"], "enforce_selected_topic": true, "hard_rejection_threshold": 5, "parked": {"unassigned_problem": [{"id": "proj-autonomous-inqu